# The modules that read this machine, with nothing standing in for them.
start shell
ipc bar show on
ipc bar add gpu end; ipc bar add cpu end; ipc bar add memory end; ipc bar add temperature end
ipc bar add disk start; ipc bar add updates start; ipc bar add fans start; ipc bar add uptime start
ipc bar add load start; ipc bar add host start
pause 4
shot real
ipc bar modules > "$SEE_OUT/board.json"
